{"seq":2,"slug":"red-team-operations","title":"红队对抗与渗透测试","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.38,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 红队对抗与渗透测试 简介\n\n红队对抗（Red Teaming）与渗透测试（Penetration Testing）是主动安全验证的两大核心手段，通过模拟真实攻击者的思维方式和技术手段，系统化地发现组织安全体系中的薄弱环节。在 2025—2026 年全球网络威胁持续升级的背景下——勒索软件攻击同比增长超过 70%、AI 驱动的自动化攻击工具大量涌现、供应链攻击事件频发——被动防御已不足以应对现实威胁，组织必须通过攻击方视角来验证防御体系的真实有效性。\n\n本手册面向安全工程师、渗透测试人员、红队操作员以及安全管理者，帮助读者系统掌握从渗透测试基础到高级红队战术的完整知识体系。无论你是刚开始接触进攻性安全的工程师，还是正在组建企业红队的安全负责人，都能从中获得可落地的方法论和实践指南。\n\n全书共分为四章，由基础到高级、从技术到管理逐步展开：\n\n第一章**渗透测试方法论**从渗透测试的标准流程和方法论入手，详细讲解信息收集与侦察技术，并介绍 Metasploit、Cobalt Strike 等主流漏洞利用框架的使用场景和核心功能。\n\n第二章**红队战术与技术**深入对手模拟的核心方法，包括基于 MITRE ATT&CK 的战术映射、横向移动与权限提升技术，以及面对 EDR/XDR 等现代防御体系时的规避与反检测技术。\n\n第三章**社会工程学**聚焦人员攻击面的利用技术，覆盖钓鱼攻击的设计与防御、伪装与心理操控的高级技巧，以及物理安全渗透测试的方法和流程。\n\n第四章**报告与持续改进**关注渗透测试和红队评估的产出价值，讲解高质量报告的撰写方法、紫队协作模式的设计与执行，以及如何建立持续安全验证机制将红队能力常态化运营。\n\n建议读者按章节顺序学习，先掌握渗透测试的基础方法和工具，再深入红队的高级战术，然后拓展到社会工程学的人因安全维度，最后将知识整合到报告输出和持续改进的闭环流程中。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"penetration-testing","title":"渗透测试方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/penetration-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pentest-methodology","title":"渗透测试方法论与流程","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/penetration-testing/pentest-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reconnaissance-techniques","title":"信息收集与侦察技术","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/penetration-testing/reconnaissance-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exploitation-frameworks","title":"漏洞利用框架与工具","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/penetration-testing/exploitation-frameworks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"red-team-tactics","title":"红队战术与技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/red-team-tactics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adversary-emulation","title":"对手模拟与 ATT&CK 映射","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/red-team-tactics/adversary-emulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lateral-movement","title":"横向移动与权限提升","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/red-team-tactics/lateral-movement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evasion-techniques","title":"防御规避与反检测技术","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/red-team-tactics/evasion-techniques"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-engineering","title":"社会工程学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/social-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"phishing-attacks","title":"钓鱼攻击设计与防御","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/social-engineering/phishing-attacks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pretexting-manipulation","title":"伪装与心理操控技术","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/social-engineering/pretexting-manipulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"physical-security-testing","title":"物理安全渗透测试","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/social-engineering/physical-security-testing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"reporting-improvement","title":"报告与持续改进","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/reporting-improvement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pentest-reporting","title":"渗透测试报告撰写","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/reporting-improvement/pentest-reporting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"purple-team-operations","title":"紫队协作与对抗演练","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/reporting-improvement/purple-team-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-security-validation","title":"持续安全验证","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/red-team-operations/reporting-improvement/continuous-security-validation"}]}]}